rkflows. CoreWeave Cloud combines proprietary software and orchestration, advanced infrastructure, and managed cloud services within a highly secure environment to deliver best-in-class high-performance computing, enabling our customers to develop, deploy, and operate advanced AI models and applications at scale.","zh":"CoreWeave 是 AITM 的必備雲，專為加速 AI 先驅者（從領先的研究實驗室到推動業務成長的企業）的突破而建置。我們的 CoreWeave 雲端平台支援人工智慧的整個生命週期，包括大規模模型訓練、推理、資料移動、持續迭代和代理工作流程。 CoreWeave Cloud 在高度安全的環境中結合了專有軟體和編排、先進的基礎設施以及託管雲端服務，以提供一流的高效能運算，使我們的客戶能夠大規模開發、部署和營運先進的人工智慧模型和應用程式。"},{"en":"AI workloads demand a fundamentally different approach to infrastructure versus general purpose cloud environments. Both training and inference require high-density compute, advanced networking, optimized storage, and software capable of managing complex distributed systems. General-purpose cloud infrastructure was not designed to meet these requirements. We address them by integrating purpose-built infrastructure with AI-native software and managed services into a single, vertically integrated platform optimized for performance, reliability, and scalability.","zh":"與通用雲端環境相比，人工智慧工作負載需要一種根本不同的基礎架構方法。訓練和推理都需要高密度運算、先進的網路、最佳化的儲存以及能夠管理複雜分散式系統的軟體。通用雲端基礎設施並不是為了滿足這些要求而設計的。我們透過將專門建置的基礎設施與人工智慧原生軟體和託管服務整合到一個針對效能、可靠性和可擴展性進行最佳化的單一垂直整合平台來解決這些問題。"},{"en":"Software underpins our platform and differentiates our ability to operate AI infrastructure at scale. Our proprietary orchestration, automation, and observability software, CoreWeave Mission ControlTM, enables CoreWeave and our customers to efficiently provision infrastructure, schedule and manage workloads, and monitor performance across training and inference environments. We offer Slurm on Kubernetes (\"SUNK\") to support large-scale AI research and training workloads. These software capabilities allow us to rapidly deploy and manage new generations of AI hardware as they become available. Being consistently among the first to scale new infrastructure, is critical in supporting our customers' rapid time-to-market for emerging AI workloads.","zh":"軟體支撐著我們的平台，並使我們大規模運作人工智慧基礎設施的能力脫穎而出。我們專有的編排、自動化和可觀察性軟體 CoreWeave Mission ControlTM 使 CoreWeave 和我們的客戶能夠有效率地配置基礎設施、安排和管理工作負載，並監控訓練和推理環境中的效能。我們提供 Slurm on Kubernetes（「SUNK」）來支援大規模人工智慧研究和訓練工作負載。這些軟體功能使我們能夠在新一代人工智慧硬體可用時快速部署和管理它們。始終是率先擴展新基礎設施的企業之一，對於支援客戶快速將新興人工智慧工作負載推向市場至關重要。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The AI cloud market is highly competitive and continues to evolve rapidly. We primarily compete with hyperscalers who offer general purpose cloud computing as part of a broader product portfolio, several of which are also customers of, and partners to, CoreWeave. We also compete with smaller cloud service providers.","zh":"AI雲端市場競爭激烈且持續快速發展。我們主要與提供通用雲端運算作為更廣泛產品組合一部分的超大規模企業競爭，其中一些企業也是 CoreWeave 的客戶和合作夥伴。我們也與較小的雲端服務供應商競爭。"},{"en":"CoreWeave's competitive advantage is a result of our platform being purpose-built for AI and accelerated compute use cases. We believe our speed to market with the latest generations of GPUs, proprietary software and orchestration platform, security standards and ability to deliver a highly attractive total cost of ownership all contribute to CoreWeave's rapid growth. Our competitive differentiation is further underpinned by our ability to service AI compute use cases of all sizes rapidly and fungibly. For more information, refer to the risk factor entitled \"We face intense competition and could lose market share to our competitors, which would adversely affect our business, operating results, financial condition, and prospects\" included in Part I, Item 1A of this Annual Report on Form 10-K.","zh":"CoreWeave 的競爭優勢源自於我們的平台專為人工智慧和加速運算用例而建置。我們相信，我們憑藉最新一代 GPU、專有軟體和編排平台、安全標準以及提供極具吸引力的總擁有成本的能力，將產品推向市場的速度都有助於 CoreWeave 的快速成長。我們快速、可替代地為各種規模的人工智慧運算用例提供服務的能力進一步鞏固了我們的競爭優勢。如需了解更多資訊，請參閱本年度報告 10-K 表格第一部分第 1A 項中標題為“我們面臨激烈競爭，可能會被競爭對手奪走市場份額，這將對我們的業務、經營業績、財務狀況和前景產生不利影響”的風險因素。"}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":4801000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":330000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":5131000000}},"peers":["NBIS","IREN","APLD","OKLO","CRCL"]}}